PAGE REQUEST REPORTS - ADMIN SIDE
=================================

Purpose
-------
This document explains the admin-side "Request Report" page flow, the functions involved, the request lifecycle, and how the UI talks to the API/model layer.

Main files
----------
1. Admin controller entry:
   - app/application/modules/admin/controllers/reports.php

