DISPLAYED BY SECTION
--------------------
This section controls the time grouping level through field:
- `interval`

Options shown on the page:
- `CUMULATIVE`
- `HOUR`
- `MONTH`
- `YEAR`

Meaning of each:
- `CUMULATIVE`
  - no time-group column is added automatically
  - report is grouped only by selected dimensions, or default entity grouping in SQL

- `HOUR`
  - report groups by hour
  - code also forces `DATE` grouping if needed
  - Excel export writes separate Date and Hour columns

- `MONTH`
  - report groups by formatted month value from SQL

- `YEAR`
  - report groups by formatted year value from SQL

How backend uses it:
- stored as `display_by`
- appended into `group_by` when not cumulative


